{"time": 1768914324, "type": "recv", "message_id": "265608914", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "（唉唉，我想把我的克里斯也塞进这种传奇团玩玩啊。。。）"}
{"time": 1768914597, "type": "recv", "message_id": "640696057", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "总之你们为了去找子爵的玺戒，来到了塞勒菲斯城"}
{"time": 1768914707, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1335956976", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "塞勒菲斯城是位于幻梦境的欧斯·纳尔盖山谷（Valley of Ooth-Nargai）中的一座宏伟的城市。其光滑的大理石墙壁和黄铜大门使其成为了幻梦境最壮观的城市之一，但最令人惊叹的是城墙内的时间是停滞的"}
{"time": 1768914774, "type": "recv", "message_id": "98234436", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=B5C8C255769A455889A1F82AABAE4CBF.png,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQjLwK_oDCJufD1UgIRAGkNi5vYzBirjwEg_woonoi_hZmakgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQ1tjSGQBEIurSJqgnJGkBDnoC8A-CAQJuag&amp;rkey=CAESMEqLNxGGm6Y-Lm9txov6oKcDDUsXfSiAW1UX7BdhxjErVRDIHYpT5yAv2UzkmkqX0w,file_size=18347]"}
{"time": 1768914783, "type": "recv", "message_id": "712208592", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "这个子爵很喜欢开宴会"}
{"time": 1768914788, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1667627834", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "这座城一直在开宴会"}
{"time": 1768914802, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1735343263", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "当你们进入到城池内部后，发现这里就正在开宴会"}
{"time": 1768914820, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1227916340", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "然后有一个看着就很华贵的人，应该就是你们要找的子爵，坐在宴会厅最中间"}
{"time": 1768914826, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1430262831", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（I2）"}
{"time": 1768914860, "type": "recv", "message_id": "177652217", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=36F15E2FD0D05984FB1AF27C9521DA7F.png,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQ83jx_mfgFEJ2U-w5jCUH2xpiQDxjc6Akg_wooheK5rpmakgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQ9X7bK5cAZvTakYBcZdUbTHoCTDSCAQJuag&amp;rkey=CAESMEqLNxGGm6Y-Lm9txov6oKcDDUsXfSiAW1UX7BdhxjErVRDIHYpT5yAv2UzkmkqX0w,file_size=160860]"}
{"time": 1768914943, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1696419796", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "这个宴会厅有很多守卫，你们大抵看下去有40个左右"}
{"time": 1768915123, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1493867078", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“子爵大人，我们得知有人意图对您的宴会发动袭击！我们正是为保护您的宴会而来！”"}
{"time": 1768915147, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1406160058", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“所需要的报酬仅需您的一枚小戒指罢了！”"}
{"time": 1768915166, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1272350889", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？你们看起来也不厉害啊”子爵感觉有点难顶“我有这么多专业保镖，也用不到你们啊”"}
{"time": 1768915262, "type": "recv", "message_id": "299270147", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“开个玩笑。”"}
{"time": 1768915274, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1026404736", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "*面无表情"}
{"time": 1768915296, "type": "recv", "message_id": "797882662", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“所以你们的来意是？”他看起来也不是很介意"}
{"time": 1768915354, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1728507476", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"Give me your ring\""}
{"time": 1768915384, "type": "recv", "message_id": "469979718", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“想要我的玺戒吗，emmm，也不是不行，不过你们要帮我一个忙”"}
{"time": 1768915428, "type": "recv", "message_id": "471378742", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "“子爵大人有什么需要的？”"}
{"time": 1768915487, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1368563564", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“是这样的，我想和我的心上人在日落时分跳日落华尔兹，但很不巧的是我还答应了其他三个人一起跳，所以我希望你帮我推脱一下”"}
{"time": 1768915505, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1666646987", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（神了）"}
