{"time": 1768915568, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1904568335", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"你用变身术变出分身可以解决吗？\""}
