{"time": 1769004546, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1637379838", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "\"你们好，谢谢你们救了我，我叫阿牛，你们怎么称呼\""}
